language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

representation AggregateLogLength.
representation MeasuredDiameter.
representation HeadCursorPosition.
representation StemSeries.
representation BuckingAlternatives.
representation AptPriceMatrix.
representation AptStandardIdentity.
representation AptAvailability.
representation StoreAptAction.
representation OperatorCommandCatalog.
representation ServiceBanner.
representation UnhandledDiagnostics.
representation SimulatorTruthView.
composition OperatorComposition.
composition SimulatorComposition.
presentation OperatorPresentationSchema.
presentation SimulatorPresentationSchema.
view MainLengthView.
view CompactLengthView.
view StemPlotView.
view AptMatrixView.

AggregateLogLength typed-as LengthValue.
AggregateLogLength describes "Current semantic length, scoped to operator context/stem; one underlying value may have two views.".
MeasuredDiameter typed-as LengthValue.
MeasuredDiameter describes "Evidence-backed calibrated diameter; explicit quality and calibration lineage.".
HeadCursorPosition typed-as LengthValue.
HeadCursorPosition describes "Current cursor separate from lagging profile history and frame cadence.".
StemSeries typed-as SeriesValue.
StemSeries describes "Domain-correlated profile sample stream; renderer receives incremental points.".
BuckingAlternatives typed-as ListValue.
BuckingAlternatives describes "Stable proposal IDs, ranking/value and permitted selection intent.".
AptPriceMatrix typed-as MatrixValue.
AptPriceMatrix describes "Stable length/diameter class axes; accepted draft revision and typed edit intent.".
AptStandardIdentity typed-as IdentityValue.
AptStandardIdentity describes "Structural discriminator for active standard/version; not a value-change schema trigger.".
AptAvailability typed-as StateRecord.
AptAvailability describes "Common and standard-specific semantics with explicit unsupported/unavailable fields.".
StoreAptAction typed-as ActionValue.
StoreAptAction describes "Domain-owned store request; no renderer codec/serialization.".
OperatorCommandCatalog typed-as StateRecord.
OperatorCommandCatalog describes "Federated upstream availability; no authority grant implied.".
ServiceBanner typed-as TextValue.
ServiceBanner describes "Global service/session/error presentation separated from unrelated box updates.".
UnhandledDiagnostics typed-as ListValue.
UnhandledDiagnostics describes "Bounded routing/failure diagnostics with drop counts and recursion exclusion.".
SimulatorTruthView typed-as StateRecord.
SimulatorTruthView describes "Explicit simulator-only hidden truth with provenance label; never normal machine evidence.".
OperatorComposition references AggregateLogLength.
OperatorComposition references MeasuredDiameter.
OperatorComposition references HeadCursorPosition.
OperatorComposition references StemSeries.
OperatorComposition references BuckingAlternatives.
OperatorComposition references AptPriceMatrix.
OperatorComposition references AptStandardIdentity.
OperatorComposition references AptAvailability.
OperatorComposition references StoreAptAction.
OperatorComposition references OperatorCommandCatalog.
OperatorComposition references ServiceBanner.
OperatorComposition references UnhandledDiagnostics.
SimulatorComposition references SimulatorTruthView.
OperatorUiDomain configures OperatorComposition.
SimulatorUiDomain configures SimulatorComposition.
OperatorUiDomain configures OperatorPresentationSchema.
SimulatorUiDomain configures SimulatorPresentationSchema.
OperatorPresentationSchema renders OperatorComposition.
SimulatorPresentationSchema renders SimulatorComposition.
MainLengthView binds-to AggregateLogLength.
CompactLengthView binds-to AggregateLogLength.
StemPlotView binds-to StemSeries.
AptMatrixView binds-to AptPriceMatrix.
MainLengthView describes "Localized primary view; display unit/precision may differ while source value stays unchanged.".
CompactLengthView describes "Second independent view of the same Representation, not a second domain subscription.".
OperatorComposition specifies "Instances are created per context/stem; references survive view replacement. No cross-session singleton or data-transfer ACK authority.".
OperatorPresentationSchema specifies "Standard-specific schema selection, trusted kinds, abstract layout/style roles and per-binding delivery; actual geometry must preserve the accepted visual reference.".
